### Role Constants
**Path**: `src/infrastructure/controllers/role/role-constants.ts`

Все роли организованы в иерархические константы:

```typescript
// Системные роли (Platform Level)
export const SYSTEM_ADMIN_ROLES = ['SUPER_ADMIN', 'PLATFORM_ADMIN'];
export const SYSTEM_ROLES = [...SYSTEM_ADMIN_ROLES, 'BILLING_ADMIN', 'SUPPORT'];

// Тенантские роли (Store Level)
export const TENANT_OWNER_ROLES = ['TENANT_OWNER'];
export const TENANT_ADMIN_ROLES = [...TENANT_OWNER_ROLES, 'TENANT_ADMIN'];
export const MANAGER_ROLES = [...TENANT_ADMIN_ROLES, 'MANAGER', 'CONTENT_MANAGER'];
export const STAFF_ROLES = [...MANAGER_ROLES, 'CUSTOMER_SERVICE'];

// Клиентские роли (User Level)
export const CUSTOMER_ROLES = ['VIP_CUSTOMER', 'WHOLESALE', 'CUSTOMER', 'AFFILIATE'];
export const GUEST_ROLES = ['GUEST'];

